1
00:00:06,140 --> 00:00:20,805
As you probably know, the town council have got £1 million to spend on improving the town’s facilities for young people and we’re looking for great ideas on how to spend the money well.

2
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:27,655
Post your ideas in the forum below and let us know how we can make life better for you.

3
00:00:28,380 --> 00:00:32,820
There’s nothing for teenagers to do in this town, especially at night.

4
00:00:33,520 --> 00:00:35,991
Can we use the money to build a youth club?

5
00:00:36,460 --> 00:00:39,780
Somewhere with a pool table and a table tennis table, perhaps.

6
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:44,560
We need somewhere to play happily and hang out safely in the evenings.

7
00:00:46,580 --> 00:00:52,257
As I’m only 14, I can’t drive, so I go everywhere on my bike.

8
00:00:52,257 --> 00:00:57,220
But the roads are dangerous and many motorists drive too fast.

9
00:00:58,120 --> 00:01:01,860
How about spending the money on building more cycle lanes?

10
00:01:02,580 --> 00:01:06,260
We could also put in more speed cameras and zebra crossings, too.

11
00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:11,120
This will make life safer for all our citizens, not just the young people.

12
00:01:12,920 --> 00:01:18,640
I think the best use for the money is to build a playground in the town park.

13
00:01:18,640 --> 00:01:24,980
It should have lots of rides for the young kids but also stuff for teenagers, too.

14
00:01:25,780 --> 00:01:36,374
I’d like to see a graffiti wall and a skateboard park for a start and maybe if there is enough money, we can have a climbing wall, too.

15
00:01:37,960 --> 00:01:46,700
Our high street is full of empty shops because everyone just shops at the new shopping centre outside of town or online.

16
00:01:46,700 --> 00:01:53,160
Why don’t we use the money to turn some of these empty shops into an arts centre?

17
00:01:54,040 --> 00:02:00,240
It can have studios where we can draw and paint or learn how to make films.

18
00:02:00,860 --> 00:02:07,013
We could also have a music studio where local bands can record music cheaply.

19
00:02:08,660 --> 00:02:17,620
How about a big billboard at the entrance to the town that reads, ‘TEEN WARNING – there’s nothing to do here!’

20
00:02:19,440 --> 00:02:26,360
This probably sounds like a boring idea, but can’t we use some of the money to buy more litter bins?

21
00:02:27,020 --> 00:02:31,260
I feel ashamed of our town when I see all the litter on the ground.

22
00:02:31,880 --> 00:02:34,500
We need to tidy up our town quickly!
